---
// Safety by design: a signature writes itself and a gold ring closes into a
// padlock beside the privacy and isolation copy.
---

<section class="safety section" id="safety" aria-labelledby="safety-title" data-inview data-safety>
  <div class="wrap safety__grid">
    <div class="seal" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 320">
        <circle cx="160" cy="160" r="140" class="seal__track"></circle>
        <circle cx="160" cy="160" r="140" class="seal__ring" pathLength="1" transform="rotate(-90 160 160)"></circle>
        <path class="seal__sig" pathLength="1" d="M70 190 C 90 150, 100 140, 110 170 S 125 205, 138 160 S 150 120, 160 168 C 166 196, 176 196, 184 170 S 196 140, 206 172 S 228 190, 250 150"></path>
        <g class="seal__lock">
          <rect x="128" y="150" width="64" height="52" rx="10"></rect>
          <path d="M140 150 v-14 a20 20 0 0 1 40 0 v14" fill="none" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
          <circle cx="160" cy="174" r="6" class="seal__key"></circle>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <p class="seal__words"><span>Private.</span> <span>Isolated.</span> <span>Locked.</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="safety__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Safety by design</p>
      <h2 id="safety-title" class="display" data-lines>
        <span class="line-mask"><span>Every clinic's data,</span></span>
        <span class="line-mask"><span>kept <em>apart.</em></span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Each clinic's records live in their own walled-off space: the database itself refuses to show one clinic's data
        to another, and the server checks again on every request. Access follows each person's role, sign-in is
        confirmed with an emailed code, and every action lands in an audit trail. Built around UK GDPR, with patients
        in control of how they're contacted.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .safety__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .seal {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .seal svg {
    width: min(100%, 22rem);
    height: auto;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .seal__track {
    fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    stroke: rgba(47, 63, 102, 0.08);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .seal__ring {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--butter-deep);
    stroke-width: 4;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 1;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(226, 196, 107, 0.55));
  }
  .seal__sig {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--ink);
    stroke-width: 3;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 1;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1;
  }
  .seal__lock {
    opacity: 0;
    transform-origin: 160px 170px;
    transform: scale(0.6);
  }
  .seal__lock rect {
    fill: var(--butter);
  }
  .seal__lock path {
    stroke: var(--butter-deep);
    transform-origin: 180px 150px;
    transform: rotate(-24deg) translateY(-6px);
  }
  .seal__key {
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__sig {
    stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.6s var(--ease-peel) 0.2s;
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__sig {
    animation: fadeSig 0.6s ease 2.3s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes fadeSig {
    to {
      opacity: 0.12;
    }
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__ring {
    stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.4s var(--ease-dew) 1.4s;
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__lock {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    transition:
      opacity 500ms ease 2.4s,
      transform 800ms var(--ease-dew) 2.4s;
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__lock path {
    transform: none;
    transition: transform 500ms var(--ease-dew) 3s;
  }
  .seal__words {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.7rem;
  }
  .seal__words span {
    opacity: 0;
    display: inline-block;
    transform: translateY(8px);
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__words span {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    transition: all 600ms var(--ease-dew);
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__words span:nth-child(1) {
    transition-delay: 1.8s;
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__words span:nth-child(2) {
    transition-delay: 2.4s;
  }
  .safety.is-in .seal__words span:nth-child(3) {
    transition-delay: 3s;
    color: var(--butter-ink);
  }
  .safety__copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }
  .facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
  }
  .fact {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--butter-line);
  }
  .fact dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .fact dd {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .safety__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .facts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
